dialect protocol
protocol stdio.bmp.mutations
version 1
schema stdio.bmp.op
start op
framing record

# Real op frame: `format u8` (`OP_BINARY_FORMAT`) then `tag u8`, then the kind's own payload (its leaf's `💾️binary` codec).
# Each record is one mutation kind at its wire tag. This file is the only source of those tags: every leaf
# codec derives its tag from its record at compile time (`dsl::protocol_record::tag_u8`).
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag u8
record set-snapshot tag=7
field payload bytes
record patch-snapshot tag=8
field payload bytes
record paint-indexed-region tag=9
field payload bytes
record paint-direct-region tag=10
field payload bytes
